{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>This day HaShem your Elohim commands you to perform</b> — Behold, Moses has finished explaining the Torah and renewing all the commandments that HaShem commanded him to renew for them. Therefore he said, <b>This day HaShem your Elohim commands you to perform these statutes and these ordinances</b>, for I have already completed everything for you. And he mentioned, <b>and you shall keep and perform them with all your heart and with all your soul</b> — and I have already explained 'heart' and 'soul' (Ramban on Deuteronomy 6:5):"], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T02:55:56.040656687Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}